show progress 0 percent
show progress 33.3 percent
show progress 50 percent
say "after bar"
show progress 100 percent
log "logged"
show progress 12.5 percent
options are
    "tea"
    "coffee"
.
choose from options into drink
say drink
if console is interactive
    say "interactive"
otherwise
    say "not interactive"
.
try
    show progress 101 percent
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    set cursor to row 1 column 1
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    set cursor to row 0 column 1
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
empty are
    "x"
.
remove "x" from empty
try
    choose from empty into nothing
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
show progress 70 percent
